---
import AplusPage from '../layouts/AplusPage.astro';
---
<AplusPage
  title="Masterclass | A+ Active Services"
  eyebrow="Free weekly masterclass"
  heading="A weekly class for private-practice AI workflows."
  intro="We use the masterclass to teach point AI, workflow AI, and compounding AI, then move interested physicians and operators into an AI Practice Audit."
>
  <section class="aplus-screen-stack" aria-label="Masterclass acquisition loop">
    <article>
      <p class="aplus-kicker">Means, motivation, opportunity</p>
      <h2>The first win is small on purpose.</h2>
      <p>Each class starts with the buyer's available means, names the motivation behind the work, and identifies the opportunity that can become a useful artifact this week.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="aplus-kicker">Compound intelligence</p>
      <h2>Docs, email, calendar, and demos become the source material.</h2>
      <p>We turn messy context into a reference track, then an ugly first draft, then a worked example that can be shown in office hours or streamed to LinkedIn.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
  <section class="aplus-content-grid">
    <article>
      <h2>What happens live</h2>
      <p>Each session focuses on one practical practice problem: after-hours documentation, front-desk work, scheduling, billing follow-up, or AI tool selection.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h2>Office hours with the trio</h2>
      <p>Members and subscribers can bring questions to focused office hours with the A+ Active trio. The goal is a concrete first workflow and a human review boundary.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h2>Why it is free</h2>
      <p>The masterclass is the front door. Join free, subscribe for reminders, then buy Healthcare Hackathon Heroes when you want templates, audit materials, and collective access.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
  <section class="aplus-flywheel-strip" aria-label="Masterclass distribution flywheel">
    <span>LinkedIn live</span>
    <span>YouTube replay</span>
    <span>Slack discussion</span>
    <span>Substack notes</span>
    <span>Twitter/X clips</span>
  </section>
</AplusPage>
